/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 47 0 R
/T (This is not a prediction. It is already the established pattern. MIT's NANDA initiative found that 95% of enterprise AI pilots deliver no measurable financial return, based on 150 leadership interviews, surveys of 350 employees and analysis of 300 public deployments. McKinsey's 2025 global survey of nearly 2,000 companies found that only 6% have reached the threshold of significant AI value at enterprise level. The majority have yet to see any measurable bottom-line impact at all. 42% of companies abandoned most of their AI initiatives in 2025, up from 17% the year before.)
/E (This is not a prediction. It is already the established pattern. MIT's NANDA initiative found that 95% of enterprise AI pilots deliver no measurable financial return, based on 150 leadership interviews, surveys of 350 employees and analysis of 300 public deployments. McKinsey's 2025 global survey of nearly 2,000 companies found that only 6% have reached the threshold of significant AI value at enterprise level. The majority have yet to see any measurable bottom-line impact at all. 42% of companies abandoned most of their AI initiatives in 2025, up from 17% the year before.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
